Subject: Cantor M2B Post Pure Prerequisite Readiness Review

Description: Between-slice architecture review after the pure Windows entry-policy and FILE_STREAM_INFO parser proofs. It distinguishes proven value transformations from unimplemented provenance, same-handle observation, physical query, admission, and traversal behavior.

