@ [stream_parser] C:\Project\Cantor\specifications\Cantor_M2B_Pure_Stream_Information_Parser.sop
@ [unsafe_seam_review] C:\Project\Cantor\narrative\research\Cantor_Windows_Topology_Unsafe_Seam_Review_2026-07-30.sop
@ [physical_plan] C:\Project\Cantor\plans\Cantor_Phase3B_3C_Physical_Proof_Plan.sop

& [ReviewIdentity] is a non-authorizing architecture checkpoint
  + [review_uuid] is 6b208de7-76c5-4044-a2de-6613abdd6561
  + [captured_at] is 2026-07-30T17:12:28.7835292-05:00
  + [baseline_commit] is c2e32c5a178a9ce77926775a6227db772ae2213c
  + [status] is pure_prerequisites_proven_next_boundary_selected_source_preserved

& [ProvenNow] is narrow and composable
  + the M2A forms validate a caller-supplied high-level TopologyEntryObservation without admitting it
  + the pure entry-policy kernel classifies supplied attributes, case flags, entry kind, component names, reserved device stems, and UTF-8 component order
  + the pure stream parser validates and decodes an exact caller-supplied FILE_STREAM_INFO byte region
  + both kernels are deterministic, effect-free, pointer-free, unsafe-free, and platform-call-free
  + both kernels return typed faults without releasing partial accepted results

& [NotProvenNow] remains explicit
  + no Win32 producer of fixed entry information is implemented
  + no Win32 producer of stream information is implemented
  + no supplied value proves that a query succeeded or that its output was fully initialized
  + no supplied values prove they were obtained from one handle, one object, or one observation epoch
  + no pure parser result proves FileStreamInfo enumeration completeness
  + no policy decision proves metadata freshness, filesystem support, physical locality, or path-to-handle identity
  + no regular-file read, pre-read versus post-read comparison, directory traversal, Git reconciliation, admission, receipt production, or launch authorization is implemented

& [MissingComposition] is an epoch-bound supplied-record seam
  + [purpose] is bind independently validated fixed-query facts and parsed stream facts into one complete raw observation candidate
  + [input] is caller-supplied observation epoch, entry kind, attributes, optional diagnostic reparse tag, strong identity, link count, length, directory flag, delete-pending flag, case flags when required, and parsed stream records
  + [output] is either one complete immutable raw Windows entry observation or one typed assembly fault
  + [epoch] is a nonzero caller-owned identity whose equality can be checked but whose physical origin cannot be inferred
  + [completeness] is explicit per required field and never synthesized from defaults
  + [coherence] cross-checks entry kind, DIRECTORY attribute, directory flag, length, link count, delete-pending state, stream shapes, and profile bounds
  + [conversion] may prepare values for the existing M2A TopologyEntryObservation only after every required raw fact is present and coherent
  - never: accept a bare boolean claiming same-handle or complete observation
  - never: treat structural coherence as proof of API success, provenance, freshness, temporal stability, or physical identity
  - never: call Windows, touch a handle, parse an address, enumerate a directory, read content, inspect Git, or authorize admission

& [WhyThisBoundary] preserves delineation
  + it closes a real data-model gap between independent pure kernels and the later private handle adapter
  + it gives the future adapter one fail-closed value target instead of scattering cross-query coherence across unsafe call sites
  + it keeps byte parsing, entry policy, observation assembly, physical production, temporal comparison, traversal, and admission independently testable
  + it can be exhaustively tested from supplied values before any new unsafe or physical authority

& [RejectedNextMoves] avoid authority collapse
  + [direct_scanner] is rejected because open, query, traversal, temporal, and fixture gates remain open
  + [stream_admission] is rejected because filesystem-specific directory and unsupported-stream behavior remains physically unmeasured
  + [physical_stream_query] is rejected because no renewed exact call and fixture authority exists
  + [generic_fact_bag] is rejected because optional untyped facts would conceal completeness and cross-field obligations
  + [neural_scoring] is rejected at this seam because safety invariants require deterministic closed forms, not learned likelihood

& [NextSourceSelection] is preserved but not authority
  + raw dictated source for the pure epoch-bound supplied-record assembly contract is preserved under source snapshot c1e8077d-add0-4abf-9fc4-be1f59b61ff8
  + process that source through SJS before forming a canonical specification
  + require a fresh satisfaction signature before implementation
  + keep all physical, Win32, unsafe, traversal, Git, receipt, launch, and promotion effects absent

& [StopConditions] are fail closed
  + stop if the source cannot distinguish caller assertion from physically established provenance
  + stop if a structurally valid value could be mistaken for a completed platform observation
  + stop if defaults could conceal a missing query result
  + stop if the design requires a handle, pointer, Windows call, filesystem read, or path enumeration
  + stop if it duplicates or weakens the existing M2A form validators

& [AuthorityEffect] is none
  + [canonical_authority] is absent
  + [implementation_authority] is absent
  + [execution_authority] is absent
  + [physical_authority] is absent
  + [publication_authority] is absent
